(text "TS06-DRV  ·  AM-PM"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 12.7 0)
(effects
(font
(size 3 3)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "eabbe58b-c52a-5156-a2ed-d494055caff2")
)
(text "One MCP23017 at I2C address 0x20 drives two К155ИД1: GPA3..0 pick the ИН-15Б glyph and GPA7..4 the ИН-15А glyph; codes 10-15 blank a tube. Each ИН-15\nis lit continuously through an 18k anode resistor, about 2.5 mA. The expander's port B drives the backlight LEDs."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "44e20cb6-6f68-5270-b535-4539f8fbd2e7")
)
(text "Codes 10-15 light nothing: the tube is blank. The firmware keeps the inverse of this table."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 254 116.84 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "2b660bb4-de0c-569d-bf6a-026875d8b78f")
)
(text "Notes from tools/ts06pair.py"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 134.62 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "edc6ab0e-7a50-544d-9fbb-f27fc22bbdab")
)
(text "R56: Static anode resistor, ИН-15Б (bench gate 2 checks it).\nR57: Static anode resistor, ИН-15А.\nU3: I2C expander at 0x20 (A0-A2 grounded), 300-mil SPDIP. GPA3..0 -> U15 (ИН-15Б), GPA7..4 -> U16 (ИН-15А), GPB0-7 -> backlight LEDs through RN1.\nU15: ИН-15Б decoder, nibble on GPA3..0 per XA_IN. Codes 10-15 blank the tube.\nU16: ИН-15А decoder, nibble on GPA7..4 per XA_IN."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 137.16 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "812ea040-410a-5438-befa-cdd0ce54197f")
)
